for the last three and a half years.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.120
It's all your successes, it's all your thoughts,

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.000
it's all your weekend work, it's all your overtime.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.520
It's a soul that's in that airplane

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.800
because each and every one of us sweated bullets

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.440
and put it there.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:28.390
Rollout is a milestone for the Boeing team.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:36.370
But as things stand now, Frank Statkis with wings would get in the air faster than the X-planes.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.570
