It is our conclusion, joined in by our colleagues from the United Kingdom,

00:54:33.670 --> 00:54:39.130
that the Lockheed Martin team is the winner of the Joint Strike Fighter program on a best-value basis.

00:54:40.100 --> 00:54:43.180
Winner of the Joint Strike Fighter program on a best-value basis.

